# ── Apex Trader dashboard frontend (Vite) ────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `dashboard/frontend/.env` and fill in. Only VITE_-prefixed vars are
# exposed to the browser bundle. `.env` is gitignored.

# Optional. Base URL for the API (leave blank to use the same origin the
# dashboard is served from).
VITE_API_URL=

# Must MATCH the backend's DD_DASHBOARD_API_KEY. When the backend key is set,
# every /api/* request and the /ws WebSocket require it, so the UI must send it.
# NOTE: this value is baked into the browser bundle at build time — it is not a
# true secret in the client. Fine for a single-user/localhost dashboard; use a
# real login/token flow if the dashboard is exposed to untrusted users.
VITE_DASHBOARD_API_KEY=
